===Etymology===
From {{m|sqj-pro|*swidertjā}}, from pre-Albanian {{m|ine-pro|*swidrotyeh₂}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sq}} {{m|ine-pro|*sweyd-}} (compare Greek {{term|ιδρός|tr=idrós|lang=el}}, English {{term|sweat|lang=en}}, Italian {{term|sudore|lang=it}})<ref>{{R:sq:Orel|page=69}}</ref>.  For Albanian ''d'' < PIE '''*sw''' compare {{m|sq|diell}}.

